# function_words.voc — Function words that can never be a noun head. Guards score_adj's
# post-positive 'NOUN ADJ' rule so a preposition/conjunction before the adjective
# isn't mistaken for the noun. Extend with closed-class words only.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

